import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const f=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 124 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 124 | Realm Refinement · Law Origin Realm · Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races","no":124,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Law Origin Realm","Myriad Races","Differentiated Cultivation","Law Manipulation"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis","10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0124_模块1-法元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md","filePath":"en/0124_模块1-法元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"}'),o={name:"en/0124_模块1-法元境-万族差异化修炼体系.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-124-law-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">Entry 124 | Law Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-124-law-origin-realm-differentiated-cultivation-system-for-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 124 | Law Origin Realm: Differentiated Cultivation System for Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 50, 52, 10</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-each-race-has-a-different-kinship-with-laws" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Each race has a different &quot;kinship&quot; with laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-each-race-has-a-different-kinship-with-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Each race has a different &quot;kinship&quot; with laws&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Transform Realm (Entry 117) covered each race&#39;s transformation craft dialect; the Law Realm&#39;s differentiation deepens into &quot;kinship with laws.&quot; Humans must learn laws from scratch; spirits are innately close to elemental laws; machine tribes treat laws as recomputable models; consciousness tribes are nearly neighbors to laws themselves — the same &quot;understanding laws,&quot; but each race&#39;s distance to laws is completely different. Using one law-touching standard to measure all Myriad Races is pressing billions of ways of conversing with the cosmos into one exam.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the legislative foundation of Myriad Race differentiation: the anti-predation axiom — each race touches laws without monopolizing or body-snatching; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — equal evolutionary qualification regardless of genealogy; the collective ascension axiom — each race&#39;s law understanding must feed back into civilization, eliminating talent underuse; the causal self-discipline axiom — cross-race law co-cultivation respects others&#39; causal boundaries; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of the Myriad Race Law differentiation system is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-law-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" tabindex="-1">I. Law Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-law-realm-differences-across-five-genealogies" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Law Realm Differences Across Five Genealogies&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Myriad Races Genealogy Overview (Document 50) and Document 14:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Genealogy</th><th>Representative groups</th><th>Law Realm features</th><th>Law affinity inclination</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Carbon-based material</td><td>Humans, beasts, wood tribe</td><td>Understanding laws from scratch, relying on training and deduction</td><td>All domains</td></tr><tr><td>Energy condensation</td><td>Spirits, elemental life</td><td>Innately close to elemental laws, difficulty is &quot;breadth&quot;</td><td>Elemental laws</td></tr><tr><td>Mechanical construction</td><td>Machine tribe</td><td>Treating laws as models, precisely recomputable</td><td>Structure, space laws</td></tr><tr><td>Consciousness information</td><td>Consciousness entities</td><td>Nearly neighbors to laws, difficulty is &quot;landing&quot;</td><td>Consciousness, logic laws</td></tr><tr><td>Hybrid variation</td><td>Half-bloods, exotic life</td><td>Starting points vary wildly, case assessment</td><td>Compatibility first</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Law Realm version of &quot;substance over name&quot;: the unified standard assesses &quot;whether basic laws of a domain are understood and preliminarily manipulated,&quot; not the specific law-touching path.</p><h2 id="ii-law-touching-paths-of-each-race-every-race-has-its-kinship" tabindex="-1">II. Law-Touching Paths of Each Race: Every Race Has Its Kinship <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-touching-paths-of-each-race-every-race-has-its-kinship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law-Touching Paths of Each Race: Every Race Has Its Kinship&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Beast tribe: touching laws through bloodline intuition, law understanding carries wildness; difficulty is &quot;taming wildness to stabilize spells&quot;</li><li>Wood tribe: touching laws through growth rhythm, deepest understanding of birth-death laws; spells are slowest yet most resilient</li><li>Spirit tribe: touching laws through elemental resonance, elemental laws near instinct; difficulty is cross-domain breadth</li><li>Machine tribe: touching laws through model recomputation, most precise at structure and space laws; difficulty is the &quot;liveness&quot; of laws</li><li>Consciousness tribe: touching laws through consciousness clarity, closest to logic and consciousness laws; difficulty is material-plane landing</li></ul><h2 id="iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-civilizational-flow-of-law-experience" tabindex="-1">III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: Civilizational Flow of Law Experience <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cross-race-co-cultivation-civilizational-flow-of-law-experience" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cross-Race Co-Cultivation: Civilizational Flow of Law Experience&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Cross-race mentors: spirit mentors help human students enter elemental laws; machine mentors help consciousness students land — the law-layer form of Myriad Race origin two-way circulation</li><li>Half-blood compatibility: half-bloods go through system compatibility assessment, eliminating race labeling</li><li>Equal certification: realm certification recognizes only law understanding depth, not birth</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-racial-narrow-mindedness-is-the-welfare-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Racial Narrow-Mindedness is the Welfare Ceiling&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo-style old-era universal welfare system did not even make non-human &quot;laws&quot; public, let alone help spirits broaden or consciousness tribes land. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: the Law Realm is not humanity&#39;s Dao-comprehension chamber, but a pantheon where all Myriad Races converse with the cosmos — 99% coverage, not a single race missing.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-law-affinity-coagulates-into-each-race-s-dao" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Law Affinity Coagulates Into Each Race&#39;s Dao <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-each-race-s-law-affinity-coagulates-into-each-race-s-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Each Race&#39;s Law Affinity Coagulates Into Each Race&#39;s Dao&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Laws understood by each race in the Law Realm must coagulate into each race&#39;s own Dao in the Dao Realm. The beast tribe coagulates understanding of power-instinct laws into &quot;Dao of Blood&quot;; the wood tribe coagulates understanding of birth-death laws into &quot;Dao of Life-Nurturing&quot;; the spirit tribe coagulates understanding of elemental laws into &quot;Dao of Reincarnation&quot;; the machine tribe coagulates understanding of structure laws into &quot;Dao of System&quot;; the consciousness tribe coagulates understanding of logic laws into &quot;Dao of Clarity.&quot; The Myriad Race origin two-way circulation manifests at this handover as: each race&#39;s Dao is not built behind closed doors, but polished more self-consciously amid cross-race dialogue. Half-bloods need system compatibility assessment at this handover — if two law understandings do not fuse, the Dao cannot be established.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: each race&#39;s law kinship is a scarce talent; a single law-touching standard is the greatest waste</li><li>Anti-predation: all races&#39; law-touching is based on publicity and self-cultivation, none on body-snatching others</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: racially narrow universal welfare is not welfare, but patronage</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: five genealogies + exotic life + multiverse residual civilizations all within the Law Realm&#39;s 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: each race&#39;s law-entry methods are openly shared, the fourth link of the fully open chain is race-blind</li></ul><p>The connection of each race&#39;s Dao also raises a deeper proposition: can Myriad Races&#39; Daos truly &quot;flourish together&quot; rather than &quot;mutually exclude&quot;? The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization answers yes — because each race&#39;s Dao points to the same origin, only different entries. The beast tribe&#39;s blood, the wood tribe&#39;s life, the spirit tribe&#39;s reincarnation, the machine tribe&#39;s system, the consciousness tribe&#39;s clarity do not conflict at the origin layer, but complement. This conviction of &quot;all Daos share one origin, all laws mutually verify&quot; is precisely the philosophical foundation of the republican axiom of Myriad Races in the Dao Realm.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Law Realm&#39;s Myriad Races dialogue panorama proves: ways of conversing with laws are billions, but the purpose of conversation is one — understand the cosmos, give back to Myriad Races. When spirit elemental intuition and machine model recomputation converse in the same Dao chamber, Myriad Race symbiosis moves from &quot;allowing difference&quot; to &quot;needing difference.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, the Law Realm Myriad Race differentiated cultivation system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./52-异族分类与共生.html">52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis</a> · <a href="./10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=a(o,[["render",s]]);export{f as __pageData,m as default};
